<title>NETHERLANDS: Stork 1996 net profit up 26 percent.</title>
<headline>Stork 1996 net profit up 26 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.58 vs   3.70</p>
<p>    Net profit			   137    vs 108.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.90 vs   1.50</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  4.92 vs   4.12</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   180.5  vs 153.1</p>
<p>    Tax				     50.1  vs  54.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected industrial systems group Stork NV to post a 1996 net of between 122 and 135 million guilders.  </p>
<p>    Interest			  gain  4.2  vs   4.0 charge</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
